        ex:hasText "Given the requirements to provide an intelligent assistance tool for hospital staff, improve efficiency and quality of care, and ensure continuity of care between professionals and services (req1, req2, req3, req6, req10, req11, req15, req42, req43, req44, req57), and considering constraints such as data sovereignty (con20, con21, con42, con56), regulatory compliance (con18, con19, con26, con27, con54), technical requirements for the solution (con1, con2, con3, con4, con5, con6, con7, con8, con9, con12, con13, con14, con15, con16, con30, con31, con32, con33, con35, con36, con37, con38, con39, con40, con41), and environmental considerations (con48, con49, con50, con59), how can we ensure the solution meets all these requirements and constraints while providing a high level of answer relevance (req56) and supporting medical coding for activity reporting (req39)?" ;
